lingmo-filemanager (5.0.5+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * desktop widgets: thread safety, SSL, and efficiency fixes.
    - worldclockwidget: serialise setenv/tzset/localtime_r with a mutex so
      concurrent threads never see a partially updated TZ variable.
    - nowplayingwidget: add CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYPEER and CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYHOST
      to album art downloads, matching weatherwidget.
    - widget/weatherwidget/nowplayingwidget: consolidate curl_global_init into
      a single RAII object; two independent once_flags would each call it.
    - countdownwidget: replace std::localtime with localtime_r (thread-safe);
      set unit labels in constructor so the first frame is not blank.
    - networkspeedwidget: switch history from std::vector to std::deque so
      the per-second pop_front is O(1) instead of O(n).
    - systemwidget: add std::max(0, …) guards on memory row geometry to
      prevent overflow when font size is large.
    - todowidget: add ItemRow::setDone() for in-place toggle updates.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0800

lingmo-filemanager (5.0.4+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * desktop widgets: fix SSL verification, timer interval and theme colour.
    - weatherwidget: explicitly enable CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYPEER and
      CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYHOST so HTTPS requests to open-meteo are always
      validated even when libcurl defaults are overridden system-wide.
    - weatherwidget: change refresh timer interval from 30 s to
      kRefreshInterval (15 min) to match the cache expiry; the previous
      value caused repeated settings-file reads on every tick with no
      network benefit.
    - widgetgallery: move subtitle colour update from layout() to
      retranslate() so it tracks theme changes instead of firing on every
      geometry pass.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 15:40:00 +0800

lingmo-filemanager (5.0.3+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * desktop widgets: add 5 new widget types:
    - WorldClock: shows up to 4 time zones, configurable in settings.
    - Countdown: counts down to a named target date (days/hours/min/sec).
    - NetworkSpeed: real-time upload/download from /proc/net/dev with
      sparkline history in Large size.
    - Todo: persistent per-instance checklist with 400 ms debounce save;
      Large size adds an inline add-item field.
    - Launcher: pinned-app icon grid (2×2 Small, 4×2 Medium, 4×4 Large)
      reading Launcher/Pins from settings, launching via base::Process.
  * desktop widgets: editing mode now animates cards with a ±1.8° sway
    (700 ms InOutQuad, infinite loop) matching iOS/macOS wiggle style.
  * desktop widgets: dragging a card within 64px of the window bottom
    dims it to 55% opacity; releasing there removes it (drag-to-delete).

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0800

lingmo-filemanager (5.0.2+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * widgets/weather: show system theme icon for weather conditions (WMO
    code mapped to 31 icon names); hand-drawn fallback kept when icon
    loading fails.
  * widgets/weather: add shared in-memory cache (15 min TTL, LRU max 10
    cities) so multiple WeatherWidgets share a single network request.
  * widgets/nowplaying: download HTTP/HTTPS album-art URLs to
    ~/.cache/lingmo-filemanager/album-art/ and load via ImageView; local
    file:// URLs continue to load directly as before.
  * widgets/widget: animate size changes with a 200 ms OutCubic transition
    instead of an instant geometry update.
  * widgets/widgetlayer: animate widget addition (scale 0.8→1, opacity
    0→1, 300 ms OutCubic) and removal (scale 1→0.8, opacity 1→0, 200 ms
    OutCubic); widget is destroyed only after the exit animation finishes.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0800

